  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING THE ROLE OF CSOS &amp; LOCAL ACTORS IN C DCD 36654 SLE.AASL.2024.01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to that citizens and civil society organisations can make active contributions to promote climate justice, accountability, and inclusive governance in Sierra Leone.  This project will support AASL and MOPADA to work with Civil Society Organisations (CSOs), national institutions, and local councils in Kailahun and Tonkolili districts: to improve climate governance; to increase accountability in the education sector; and to enhance civil society space by improving CSOs and government&#x2019;s understanding of their respective roles and responsibilities.</narrative>
  </description>
